      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 106359247,
      "text": "クグガヤツリ Cyperus compressus L. は、小型のカヤツリグサ属の植物。道ばたなどに生え、草丈の割には大きな小穂が特徴。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Cyperus compressus」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyperus_compressus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1377650924,
      "text": "Cyperus compressus, commonly known as annual sedge, is a sedge of the family Cyperaceae that has a wide distribution throughout countries with warmer climates. It is found in tropical areas of Africa, Asia and the Americas."
    }
